<title>SWEDEN: Stockholm airport moves 8.6 pct more mail in 1995.</title>
<headline>Stockholm airport moves 8.6 pct more mail in 1995.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockholm's international airport loaded and unloaded 25,831 tonnes of mail in 1995, a rise of 8.6 percent over the previous year, the 1995 yearbook published by Sweden's civil aviation authority showed.</p>
<p>Luftfartsverket published the following statistics about mail handled at Sweden's state-owned and military airports in the newly-released annual report.</p>
<p> AIRPORT	     TOTAL	 TOTAL	  INT'L	DOMESTIC</p>
